10         Program Purpose: Calculate RRs and PARs for the association between maternal factors and obesity
11         stratified by sex
12         Exposures: &mowestq_ [quantiles]; &mopaq_ [quantiles]; &mosmk_ [categorical]; &moshift_ [categorical];
13         	moob [binary]
14         Stratifiers: sex
15         Statistical Analyses:
16         	1) proc genmod to calculate multivariable log-binomial model with generalized estimating equations (GEE),
17         	a Poisson distribution, and an unstructured correlation structure, accounting for correlations across
18         	time for the same child and between siblings born to the same mother
19         	2) population attributable fraction with %par macro
20         
